{"step_index":228,"source":"SYSTEM","type":"CHECKPOINT","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-28T03:48:13Z","content":"# Resuming from a compaction\n\nYou are continuing work on the task described above, but you have lost access to the full conversation history, and need to resume work efficiently using the progress summary below:\n\n# User Requests\nThe following were user requests from the truncated conversation in chronological order:\n1. bạn hãy đọc file prompt này và hãy tạo cho tôi 1 prompt cho tôi về web tôi mô tả\n2. vậy bạn hãy tạo trang web mà bạn vừa prompt giúp tôi luôn được không \n3. tôi đang có 1 vấn đề là bạn hãy cập nhật thêm cho tôi là ví dụ như tôi thêm task A1.3 thì nó sẽ nằm sau A1.2 được không . do tôi thấy sau khi tôi thêm task vào nó hiện ở dưới cùng\n4. 1.tôi đang thấy là khi tôi tạo công việc ở ảnh 2 cho một nhân sự thì tôi thấy nó có cập nhật tên task vào bên phải của anh 2 đó mà tôi không thấy nó hiện bên trái của ảnh hai và không có kẻ xanh với đường gantt nối xuống , với lại bạn chỉnh lại giúp tôi cái đường gantt với tên công việc dự án và tên dự án nó đang bị lệch . \n2.và cập nhật thêm giúp tôi là khi tôi tạo công việc ở ảnh 2 thì bên ảnh 1 người đảm nhận công việc đó phải hiện thêm công việc tôi tạo cho và bên ảnh 1 cũng có tạo công việc thì tôi muốn nó cũng đồng bộ bên ảnh 2 là khi tạo công việc cho nhân sự thì hai bên đều đồng bộ với nhau \n\n<summary>\n### 1. Task Overview\n- **User Request:**\n  1. Fix visual misalignment in the Gantt chart (`GanttPage.jsx`) where the Gantt bars and vertical dependency lines drift out of sync with project/task names on the left table.\n  2. Ensure complete 2-way synchronization between:\n     - **Ảnh 1 / Mục 1: Phân Công Công Việc (`TasksPage.jsx`)** and **Trang 1: Nhân Sự (`HRPage.jsx`)**.\n     - **Ảnh 2: Tiến Độ Dự Án (`GanttPage.jsx`)**.\n     When a task is created or modified in Gantt (Ảnh 2), the assigned employee in Trang 1 must show the new task under their name (increasing task count), and it must appear in Phân Công (Ảnh 1). Conversely, tasks created in Phân Công (Ảnh 1) must sync into Gantt (Ảnh 2) with a Gantt bar, proper WBS position, and a vertical connecting dependency line (\"đường gantt nối xuống\").\n  3. Ensure that newly added tasks in Gantt always display their horizontal colored bar and the downward connecting dependency line (\"kẻ xanh với đường gantt nối xuống\").\n\n---\n\n### 2. Progress\n- **Backend synchronization implemented:**\n  - `backend/src/controllers/hrController.js`: Updated `getEmployees` to query assigned tasks from both `db.tasks` and `db.ganttItems` (by both `employeeId` and case-insensitive `employeeName`).\n  - `backend/src/controllers/projectController.js`: Updated `createGanttItem` to automatically insert tasks into `db.tasks` (matching employee by name), auto-link predecessor dependencies if empty, and sync deletions.\n  - `backend/src/controllers/taskController.js`: Updated `createTask` to automatically generate WBS codes (e.g., `A1.X`, `B1.X`), insert into `db.ganttItems` using hierarchical WBS sorting (`compareWbs`), auto-link dependency to the previous item in that phase, and sync updates/deletions.\n- **Frontend GanttPage logic partially updated:**\n  - `frontend/src/modules/gantt/GanttPage.jsx`:\n    - Updated `ROW_HEIGHT = 44`, `HEADER_HEIGHT = 52`, `BAR_HEIGHT = 24`.\n    - Updated `dependencyLines` calculation to auto-link to the previous task when `dependencies` is empty so a downward connection line is always drawn.\n- **Remaining / Incomplete Work:**\n  - Updating the HTML table markup and SVG layout in `frontend/src/modules/gantt/GanttPage.jsx` to lock exact row heights (`h-[44px] min-h-[44px] max-h-[44px] box-border`) and header heights (`h-[52px] min-h-[52px] max-h-[52px]`), removing `divide-y` to prevent vertical drift between left table and right Gantt bars.\n  - Updating `frontend/src/modules/tasks/TasksPage.jsx` to allow optional WBS code input in the task creation form and verify 2-way sync across all screens.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Key Findings & Decisions\n- **Root Cause of Gantt Misalignment:**\n  - In `GanttPage.jsx`, the left table header text `\"CÔNG VIỆC TRONG DỰ ÁN\"` wrapped onto two lines because its column was too narrow (`flex-1` with padding), causing the left header container to expand to ~60px+. Meanwhile, the right SVG assumed `HEADER_HEIGHT = 50px`.\n  - In the left table rows, `divide-y` added `border-top: 1px` to each row without strict `box-border min-h-[44px] max-h-[44px]`, causing an additional ~1px downward drift per row. By row 8+, the bars were off by almost a full row.\n  - **Fix:** Set exact matching `HEADER_HEIGHT = 52` on both headers with `whitespace-nowrap truncate` on the column header. Remove `divide-y` and enforce `h-[44px] min-h-[44px] max-h-[44px] box-border border-b border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800` on every row. Set SVG line/bar Y coordinates to match `HEADER_HEIGHT + idx * ROW_HEIGHT`.\n- **Root Cause of Missing Connecting Lines:**\n  - When `dependencies` is empty `[]`, no SVG path was rendered. Auto-linking to the immediate predecessor (`filteredGanttItems[toIndex - 1].id`) guarantees the blue dashed FS line (\"đường gantt nối xuống\") always renders.\n\n---\n\n### 4. Active Context\n- **Project Directory:** `C:\\Users\\GiaWyy\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\aps-project-manager`\n- **Active Background Daemon Tasks:**\n  - `task-174`: Backend server running via `node --watch src/server.js` on `http://localhost:5000/api`.\n  - `task-99`: Frontend Vite dev server running on `http://localhost:3000`.\n- **Key Files Modified:**\n  - `backend/src/controllers/hrController.js`\n  - `backend/src/controllers/projectController.js`\n  - `backend/src/controllers/taskController.js`\n  - `frontend/src/modules/gantt/GanttPage.jsx`\n\n---\n\n### 5. Next Steps\n1. **Apply HTML/CSS Row Lock in `frontend/src/modules/gantt/GanttPage.jsx`:**\n   - In Left Table header: set fixed width columns (`w-14`, `w-60 min-w-[240px] whitespace-nowrap truncate`, `w-14`, `w-20`, `w-20`, `w-14`, `w-24`, `w-20`), header height `h-[52px] min-h-[52px] max-h-[52px]`.\n   - In Left Table rows: replace `divide-y` with individual row `h-[44px] min-h-[44px] max-h-[44px] box-border border-b border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800/80 overflow-hidden`.\n   - In Right Header: set `h-[52px] min-h-[52px] max-h-[52px]`.\n   - In SVG: draw row separator lines at `HEADER_HEIGHT + (idx + 1) * ROW_HEIGHT` and position bars at `HEADER_HEIGHT + idx * ROW_HEIGHT + 10`.\n2. **Update `frontend/src/modules/tasks/TasksPage.jsx`:**\n   - Ensure the modal form for \"+ Tạo Task Công Việc Mới\" includes an optional WBS code input and passes all fields to `addTask`, ensuring full 2-way data flow.\n3. **Verify Build & Test:**\n   - Run `npm run build` in `frontend/` to confirm zero compilation errors.\n   - Test creating a task in `TasksPage` and checking `GanttPage` and `HRPage`.\n   - Test creating a task in `GanttPage` and checking `TasksPage` and `HRPage`.\n4. **Respond to User:** Explain how the alignment was mathematically locked and how full 2-way sync between all 3 screens was achieved.\n\n---\n\n### 6. Commitments & Constraints\n- Keep `frontend/` and `backend/` cleanly separated with comments in Vietnamese.\n- Preserve WBS hierarchical placement (e.g. `A1.3` after `A1.2`).\n- Both dev servers are live on Windows at ports 3000 and 5000; ensure `npm run build` passes before completing.\n</summary>\n\nYou have the 4 following artifacts written to the artifacts directory:\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1790563408510]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/GiaWyy/.gemini/antigravity/brain/fefb2235-8c9c-4fe2-a4d4-1f9fd97a006c/.user_uploaded/media_1790563408510.docx\nLast Edited: 2026-09-28T02:44:00Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1790565733468]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/GiaWyy/.gemini/antigravity/brain/fefb2235-8c9c-4fe2-a4d4-1f9fd97a006c/.user_uploaded/media_1790565733468.png\nLast Edited: 2026-09-28T03:28:29Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1790566878784]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/GiaWyy/